window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>When love is toxic and unforgivable, but you can't let it go...</b></p> <p>He was the man who destroyed me, the monster who left me in pieces over a decade ago. I swore I'd never speak to him again, that I'd never set eyes on him again as long as I lived.</p> <p>But I was wrong.</p> <p>When life gets too much, and you need a release, the poison that might kill you becomes oh-so-tempting. I craved his body, his smirk, his laughter as he pushed me to my limits.</p> <p>I needed him. Just once. Just one night. That's what I told myself.</p> <p>No strings, no illusions, no promises. Nothing but the lasting thrill of his flesh on mine.</p> <p>But when poison runs through your veins the way he runs through mine, it's toxic and eats you alive.</p> <p>And this much passion always comes at a price...</p> <p><i>This brand new second chance romance from Jade West promises to thrill.</i></p>"; 
